{"id": "q0111", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3298877096, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Find all the integer roots of\n\\[x^4 + 5x^3 + 9x^2 - x - 14 = 0.\\]Enter all the integer roots, separated by commas.\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0111.wav", "input_sha256": "403ff1eba2578b65b01ae44c3e883f600df61b1a425fdbbbdbdb013e4eb5f218", "input_samples": 168600, "input_s": 10.537, "n_real_chunks": 11, "score": 0.7672, "act": 0.9988, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Okay, so we need to find all the integer roots of this cubic equation. Let's start by fact oring it if possible. The equation is x cubed minus 4 x squared minus x minus fourteen equals zero. I can try using the rational root theorem here. The possible rational roots are plus or minus factors of the constant term divided by factor s of the leading coefficient. Since the leading coefficient is one and the constant term is negative fourteen, the possible integer roots are plus or minus one, two, seven, and fourteen. Now let' s test these values in the equation. Start with x equal to one: One cubed is one, minus four times one squared is minus four, minus one, minus fourteen. That gives one minus four minus one minus fourteen, which is minus twenty. Not zero, so one isn't a root. Next, try x equal to two: Two cube d is eight, minus four times four is minus sixteen, minus two, minus fourteen. So that's eight minus sixteen is minus eight, minus two is minus ten, minus fourteen is minus twenty-four. Still not zero. How about x equal to seven? Seven", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 10, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0111_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "f352d677776d07f760252494f1c268757b6eaf6394fa6ce09be8ad3fb5427778", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.066, 1.12, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.07, 2.125, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.083, 3.152, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.081, 4.152, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.071, 5.127, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.079, 6.137, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.07, 7.127, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.071, 8.126, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.072, 9.13, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.072, 10.126, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 10.537, 10.617, 11.162, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.612, 12.29, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.537, 12.607, 13.255, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.537, 13.61, 14.208, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.537, 14.609, 15.27, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.537, 15.61, 16.292, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.538, 16.612, 17.145, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.538, 17.629, 18.348, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.538, 18.626, 19.309, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.538, 19.614, 20.306, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.538, 20.661, 21.514, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.538, 21.621, 22.295, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.538, 22.623, 23.332, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.538, 23.625, 24.383, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.538, 24.624, 25.301, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.538, 25.665, 26.457, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.538, 26.626, 27.306, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.538, 27.628, 28.359, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.538, 28.618, 29.316, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.538, 29.619, 30.285, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.538, 30.615, 31.318, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.538, 31.617, 32.357, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.538, 32.611, 33.189, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.538, 33.616, 34.269, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.538, 34.617, 35