{"id": "q0142", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 551451479, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "For what value of $x$ is $2^3\\cdot3^x=72$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0142.wav", "input_sha256": "892673ec20732ba56b043ab5701c10907ce42a4b7da9687cdab98ab5e9676a24", "input_samples": 88200, "input_s": 5.513, "n_real_chunks": 6, "score": 0.7642, "act": 0.9988, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we have 2 times 3, which is 6. Then we add x to that. And the whole thing equals 7 2. So if I subtract 6 from both sides, I get x equals 72 minus 6, which is 6 6. So x equal s 66.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 5, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 17, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0142_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "c693af8e8c551390e721950c72c62270b940f384e1d3f5259544d36690635bdd", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 17.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.125, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.069, 2.124, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.069, 3.126, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.072, 4.131, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.068, 5.124, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 5.513, 5.582, 6.03, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.513, 6.583, 7.198, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.513, 7.584, 8.255, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.512, 8.581, 9.242, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.512, 9.583, 10.188, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.512, 10.582, 11.276, 0, 24000, 0], [11,