{"id": "q0212", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1609511243, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Using the definition of the unilateral Z transform, F (z) = ^\\infty\\sum_n=0 f[n] z^-n. find the z - transform of the step-sequence f[n] = u[n].\n\nA. [1 / (z - 1)]\nB. [z / (1 + z)]\nC. [z^2 / (z - 1)]\nD. [1 / (2 - z)]\nE. [(z - 1) / z]\nF. [1 / (z^2 - 1)]\nG. [1 / (1 - z)]\nH. [z / (1 - z)]\nI. [z / (z - 1)]\nJ. [z / (z^2 - 1)]\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0212.wav", "input_sha256": "cb0c43215556db43fa36a18e812d62c788eedc36caf1f0b4e579a75b19d2a79a", "input_samples": 383600, "input_s": 23.975, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.8548, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The unilateral Z- transform of the step sequence f[n] = u[n] is 1 divided by 1 minus z to the minus n. So the answer is option E.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 24, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 10, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0212_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "38b6449466d46fa919cad2bb94eff651144ee1706a7d7415217e53d5c4665d97", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 10.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.08, 1.145, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.082, 2.145, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.084, 3.148, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.083, 4.151, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.075, 5.132, 1, 0, 