{"id": "q0425", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3995831193, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Provide a bulleted list of things to think about when buying a house", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0425.wav", "input_sha256": "9e6324dca26b1ad3031b2273503cffcd44dcf8caad3c270cbc37b8ffa7bf4a9d", "input_samples": 62400, "input_s": 3.9, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.5295, "act": 0.9951, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, the first thing to consider is location. Where do you want to live? Do you want to be in a city or suburb s? What are the schools like nearby? The next thing to think about is size and layout. How many bedrooms and bathroom s do you need? Is there enough space for your family? Also, make sure that the house has good flow between rooms so it feels comfortable when you're living there. Another important factor is condition. You should inspect the property thoroughly before buying it. Look at the roof, foundation, plumbing, electrical systems, etc., to see if any major repairs will be needed soon. It' s also wise to hire a professional home inspector who can help identify potential problems that might not be obvious at first glance. Next, think about financing. Make sure you understand all of the costs associated with purchasing a home, such as down payments, closing fees, taxes, insurance, and other expenses. Finally, don't forget to check local zoning laws and regulations to ensure that the property is zoned correctly for residential use. This could affect whether you can build an addition or add a pool later on.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 55, "feed_lag_max_ms": 17, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 17, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0425_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "56b56383aa03e7b1dde3dec7b23ab7b2b26c33fcd73df21810bbda9ca5d98c73", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 55.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.083, 1.15, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.08, 2.145, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.084, 3.152, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.9, 3.97, 4.027, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.9, 4.971, 5.567, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.9, 5.984, 6.648, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.9, 6.968, 7.587, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.9, 7.985, 8.579, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.9, 8.967, 9.605, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.9, 9.968, 10.638, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.9, 10.967, 11.683, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.9, 11.97, 12.681, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.9, 12.988, 13.71, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.9, 13.968, 14.838, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.9, 14.976, 15.653, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.9, 15.974, 16.636, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.9, 16.969, 17.69, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.9, 17.99, 18.778, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.9, 18.987, 19.89, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.9, 19.985, 20.77, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.9, 20.991, 21.751, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.9, 21.975, 22.679, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.9, 22.978, 23.811, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.9, 23.979, 24.598, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.9, 24.984, 25.608, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.9, 25.99, 26.732, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.9, 26.971, 27.597, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.9, 27.969, 28.678, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.9, 28.99, 29.635, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.9, 29.971, 30.616, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.9, 30.969, 31.542, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.9, 31.99, 32.7, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.9, 32.968, 33.674, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.9, 33.97, 34.555, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.9, 34.988, 35.788, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.9, 35.975, 36.587