{"id": "q0497", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3822138238, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "提供三个市场营销活动的想法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0497.wav", "input_sha256": "2f39f9713ae0de2999899f625e5634b101feac7d7d12971e9ce00e43b2e7e4a3", "input_samples": 48000, "input_s": 3.0, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.1665, "act": 0.9981, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，给你三个市场营销活动的想法。第一个是社交媒体挑战赛，比如用户拍摄和分享与品牌相关的短视频并带话题标签，获奖者可以获得优惠券或产品奖励。第二个是限时优惠日，举办一天的特别促销活动，通过邮件通知老客户参与，增加销量。第三个是联名合作推广，和其他品牌合作推出联名产品或互推活动，扩大受众群体。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 28, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0497_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "897c28be8e95c07f6c0a16a0c293b0c3bf9acc07b9013007d09e73ec12e8e4d3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 28.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.087, 1.156, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.076, 2.135, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.076, 3.136, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 4.0, 4.076, 4.14, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 5.0, 5.086, 5.722, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 6.0, 6.079, 6.809, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 7.0, 7.093, 7.864, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 8.0, 8.076, 8.721, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 9.0, 9.081, 9.972, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 10.0, 10.075, 10.737, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 11.0, 11.074, 11.737, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 12.0, 12.076, 12.859, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 13.0, 13.08, 13.751, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 14.0, 14.086, 14