{"id": "q0517", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 717935425, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "清洁白板的步骤：", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0517.wav", "input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "input_samples": 24600, "input_s": 1.538, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.3474, "act": 0.9857, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "首先用湿布轻轻擦去白板上的灰尘和干粉。然后喷上专门的白板清洁剂，等几秒钟让它起作用。接着用干净的抹布或纸巾把污渍擦掉。如果有顽固印记，可以用微湿的布轻轻摩擦。最后用干净的布再擦一遍，确保没有残留水迹。记得定期清洁，保持白板表面光滑易写。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 27, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "2d2b79b55bd2b5ba54f94e2b17a29c54ac1cb39f18529b2ee85fb902d6b4a04b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 27.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.126, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.538, 1.608, 1.666, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.538, 2.624, 2.692, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.612, 4.282, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.625, 5.444, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.609, 6.249, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.611, 7.411, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.612, 8.356, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.63, 9.438, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.62, 10.295, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.622, 11.401, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.607, 12.333, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.537, 12.622, 13.325, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.537, 13.618, 14.294, 